# Private notes and design docs not for the public repo. Move things in here
# rather than committing them; the working tree keeps the content for personal
# reference, git stops tracking. See `docs/internal/README.md` for the rationale.
docs/internal/
TODO.md

# Ops + internal notes kept in a separate private companion repo.
# These globs are belt-and-braces so they can't accidentally be re-added.
ansible/
docs/superpowers/
docs/*-rollout.md
docs/*-todo.md
docs/todo.md

# Only kitchen-sink ships as an in-tree plugin (a worked example). Anything
# else dropped into plugins/ during dev — symlinks, separate clones, scratch
# work — should NOT be committed. The lockfile-hygiene CI job also catches
# this if a non-kitchen-sink workspace makes it into package-lock.json.
plugins/*
!plugins/kitchen-sink/
